        Universal <span class="search-hit mathjax">language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">model</span> with the intervention of quantum theory
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Qin%2C+D+-">D. -F. Qin</a>
      
