        JaccDiv: A Metric and Benchmark for Quantifying Diversity of Generated Marketing Text in the Music Industry
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Afzal%2C+A">Anum Afzal</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Mercier%2C+A">Alexandre Mercier</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Matthes%2C+F">Florian Matthes</a>
      
