        SetKE: Knowledge Editing for Knowledge Elements Overlap
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wei%2C+Y">Yifan Wei</a>, 
      
