        Confidence in Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> Evaluation: A Bayesian Approach to Limited-Sample Challenges
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xiao%2C+X">Xiao Xiao</a>, 
      
